  "indias-carbon-credit-market-domestic": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Ambuja_Cements_Limited_20020400.jpg/960px-Ambuja_Cements_Limited_20020400.jpg\" alt=\"Ambuja Cements factory at Dhulagarh, Howrah, India\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Cement is one of the first-batch sectors obligated under India's new Carbon Credit Trading Scheme, alongside chlor-alkali, pulp and paper, and aluminium. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ambuja_Cements_Limited_20020400.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ambuja Cements Limited 20020400.jpg</a>, Biswarup Ganguly, CC BY-SA 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
  },
  "lpgs-missing-number-7308-commission-and": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/LPG_Cylinders_Loading_Onto_Boat_-_River_Matla_-_Godkhali_-_South_24_Parganas_2016-07-10_4880.JPG/960px-LPG_Cylinders_Loading_Onto_Boat_-_River_Matla_-_Godkhali_-_South_24_Parganas_2016-07-10_4880.JPG\" alt=\"LPG cylinders being loaded onto a distribution boat in West Bengal, India\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">The distributor commission this piece tracks down covers exactly this last-mile work — moving subsidised cylinders from depot to doorstep. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LPG_Cylinders_Loading_Onto_Boat_-_River_Matla_-_Godkhali_-_South_24_Parganas_2016-07-10_4880.JPG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LPG Cylinders Loading Onto Boat - River Matla - Godkhali - South 24 Parganas 2016-07-10 4880.JPG</a>, Biswarup Ganguly, CC BY 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
  },
  "whos-actually-building-mri-and-ct": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/MRI_Scanner_at_Narayana_Multispeciality_Hospital%2C_Jaipur.jpg/960px-MRI_Scanner_at_Narayana_Multispeciality_Hospital%2C_Jaipur.jpg\" alt=\"An MRI scanner installed at Narayana Multispeciality Hospital, Jaipur\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">The diagnostic imaging capacity India's hospitals keep adding faster than domestic manufacturers can supply it. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRI_Scanner_at_Narayana_Multispeciality_Hospital,_Jaipur.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MRI Scanner at Narayana Multispeciality Hospital, Jaipur.jpg</a>, GeorgeWilliams21, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
  },
  "vehicles-out-motors-in-indias-chapter": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Optima_Plus_%28Hero_Electric%2C_India%29.jpg/960px-Optima_Plus_%28Hero_Electric%2C_India%29.jpg\" alt=\"Hero Electric Optima Plus, an Indian electric two-wheeler driven by a BLDC motor\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">An Indian electric two-wheeler built around the kind of BLDC motor that sits in HSN Chapter 85 — the electrical-machinery chapter where India's trade deficit keeps widening even as Chapter 87 vehicle exports grow. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Optima_Plus_(Hero_Electric,_India).jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Optima Plus (Hero Electric, India).jpg</a>, Viswaprabha, CC BY-SA 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
  },
  "india-mineral-oil-hsn-ch27-trade": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Crude_oil_tanker_Eagle_San_Diego.jpg/960px-Crude_oil_tanker_Eagle_San_Diego.jpg\" alt=\"A crude oil tanker underway\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Crude and refined mineral oil — HSN Chapter 27 — move between India and its top trade partners largely aboard tankers like this one. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crude_oil_tanker_Eagle_San_Diego.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Crude oil tanker Eagle San Diego.jpg</a>, Jordanroderick, CC0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>"
  },
  "indias-coffee-crop-hasnt-grown-in": {
